  m_text: "\u0110\xE0 N\u1EB5ng is a coastal city in central Vietnam known for its
    beautiful beaches, scenic mountains, and rich cultural heritage. It\u2019s often
    called the \u201CGateway to Central Vietnam\u201D because it\u2019s conveniently
    located near several famous tourist destinations.\nHere\u2019s a closer look
    at what makes \u0110\xE0 N\u1EB5ng special:\n\nBeautiful Beaches: \u0110\xE0
    N\u1EB5ng is famous for its long, sandy beaches, especially My Khe Beach, which
    is known for its white sand and clear water. The beaches are perfect for swimming,
    sunbathing, and water sports.\n\nMarble Mountains (Ng\u0169 H\xE0nh S\u01A1n):
    This cluster of five limestone and marble hills is home to ancient temples, caves,
    and pagodas, with breathtaking views from the top. Each mountain is named after
    one of the five elements (metal, ......."
